From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] transport: add Mihomo-compatible Kcptun inbound and outbound

Port Mihomo v1.19.32 Kcptun settings, cipher selection, FEC, compression and
smux v1/v2 as a separate UDP-based reliable stream transport. Preserve mKCP.
Own client pools per outbound and destination, reclaim expired sessions and
close pooled sockets with their outbound. Track and close accepted server
sessions and adapt stream addresses for Xray protocols. Use Xray socket
options, outbound gateway selection and finalmask packet wrappers.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/app/proxyman/outbound/handler.go
+++ b/app/proxyman/outbound/handler.go
@@ -329,6 +329,7 @@
 
 // Close implements common.Closable.
 func (h *Handler) Close() error {
+	common.Close(h.streamSettings)
 	common.Close(h.mux)
 	common.Close(h.proxy)
 	return nil
